"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Both usually mean a dock fault rather than a bike fault.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source_b states this generalization directly.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Ask the rider to read the code on the dock display.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Matches source_b's instruction directly.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A dock showing E2 has a jammed locking pin.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A dock showing E4 has lost power to the point.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"E2 is a mechanical fault\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"E4 is an electrical one\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a, meaning E4 is electrical fault.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"they are\\nescalated differently\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Free the pin with the service key\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"cycle the dock twice\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"If the dock takes a bike and releases it on both cycles, close the fault on your handheld.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Raise an E2 to the field crew.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_b.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Escalate E2 to the workshop after 2 failed attempts.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a; single-source support suffices.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Do not keep cycling a dock\\nthat has failed twice\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"repeated forcing bends the pin\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"turns a 20 minute workshop job into a replacement\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Report E4 to the electrical contractor the same day.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a, also matched in source_b.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-019\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Field crew do not open the\\npower enclosure under any circumstances.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-020\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A rider charged for a journey that ended at a faulted dock gets the journey\\nrefunded.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_b.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-021\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Refund at the time of the call\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_b.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-022\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"do not wait for the fault to be\\nconfirmed\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_b.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-023\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A station with more than half its docks faulted is taken out of service in the\\napp.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a, matched in source_b.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"M-024\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Tell the support desk before you do this, not after.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Stated directly in source_a.\"}\n]}","ttft_ms":8427,"type":"result","duration_ms":20160,"uuid":"4be476da-ecf7-4186-b7be-39e240bdef0c","ttft_stream_ms":1396,"time_to_request_ms":119,"first_content_frame_ms":1397,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
